      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_0175c56ca1cf5c0c_1",
        "edit": "In the combinational always block, invert the enable condition from `if(ena)` to `if(!ena)` so that y is forced to 0 when ena is low and the one-hot decode is applied when ena is high, matching the oracle observations.",
